+# Operator Runbook — Prefilled PoA & KPI Baseline
+
+Prereqs
+- Ensure secrets are set (COSIGN_KMS_URI, REKOR_SERVER, S3_UPLOAD) in CI or export locally.
+- Ensure at least one builder is hardened and labeled (see ops/ci/builder_onboard_instructions.md).
+- Ensure Kubernetes context has GPU nodepool present.
+
+Run the PoA (local)
+1. Export env & run:
+   export TARGETS="falcon-ecu-01:can0"
+   export INVARIANT="ops/formal/specs/safety.tla"
+   export NPU_RUNNERS="npu-1.example.com,npu-2.example.com"
+   export GPU_FAMILY="a100"
+   export CLOUD_PROVIDER="aws"
+   export COSIGN_KMS_URI="kms://projects/.../keys/..."
+   export REKOR_SERVER="https://rekor.example.com"
+   export S3_UPLOAD="s3://aegis-evidence"
+   ./ops/runbooks/prefilled_one_click_pofa.sh
+
+2. After run, find OUT dir (printed at end), then:
+   python3 ops/metrics/kpi_baseline_template.py --report $OUT/pofa_report.json --out $OUT/pofa_kpi_baseline.json
+
+Run in CI (GitHub Actions)
+1. Create repository secrets used in .github/workflows/prefilled_pofa_and_kpi.yml:
+   - AEGIS_TARGETS, AEGIS_INVARIANT, AEGIS_NPU_RUNNERS, AEGIS_GPU_FAMILY, AEGIS_CLOUD_PROVIDER
+   - COSIGN_KMS_URI, REKOR_SERVER, S3_UPLOAD
+2. Trigger workflow: Actions → Prefilled PoA + KPI Baseline → Run workflow_dispatch.
+
+Compare before/after
+1. Save baseline before changes: before.json
+2. After improvements, re-run PoA and produce after.json
+3. Compare:
+   python3 ops/metrics/compare_kpi_reports.py --before before.json --after after.json --out diff.json
+
+Owners & escalation
+- Infra: provision GPU nodes, harden builders.  
+- Platform: run PoA, collect KPIs, triage HIL/Formal failures.  
+- Controls: HIL runs and Apalache triage.  
+- Security: validate provenance (cosign/Rekor) and remediate builder issues.
