+# One‑Click PoA & KPI Baseline — Quick Template
+
+What it does
+- Runs a prefabricated PoA (data prep, sharded smoke train, sim/HIL, formal checks, auditor bundle) and emits pofa_report.json.  
+- Converts pofa_report.json into a KPI baseline and stores pofa_kpi_baseline.json for future comparisons.
+
+How to use
+- Local: export envs and run ops/runbooks/prefilled_one_click_pofa.sh then ops/metrics/kpi_baseline_template.py.  
+- CI: use .github/workflows/prefilled_pofa_and_kpi.yml with repository secrets.
+
+Baseline fields produced
+- pofa_total_duration_s, pofa_stage_count, human_hours_before/after, stage list.
+
+Comparison tool
+- ops/metrics/compare_kpi_reports.py produces simple deltas (duration delta, stage count delta, human hours saved).
